{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTg0NjM2","is_bot":false,"login":"PowerVANO","name":""},"body":"Currently, the user guide of Horizen Stake Verification Tools is written for Linux.\r\n\r\n**Scope of Work**\r\n\r\n- Update [README.md on GitHub](https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/blob/master/README.md) and [the user guide of Horizen Stake Verification Tool](https://horizenofficial.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ZEN/pages/2127101965/Single+Address+Staking) to include a command line syntax and guide for Windows as well.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Schedule/Milestones**\r\n\r\nThis task should be completed within 2 weeks once accepted. If a user does not complete this task within the allotted time it will be considered open for another user to complete. For the task to be considered complete, it will need to be reviewed and approved by the Horizen team. The team may request edits be made to the contribution before approval.\r\n\r\nUsers who accept this task must provide weekly updates during the period they are working on the task.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Budget**\r\n\r\n~~$50 USD (Paid in ZEN)~~\r\n**$100 USD (Paid in ZEN)**\r\n","comments":[{"id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg3MTQ5OTIzMA==","author":{"login":"PowerVANO"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hey @JdevStudios \r\n\r\nYou can claim the task. Please go ahead and start your work.\r\n\r\nAlso, please provide weekly updates about your progress.","createdAt":"2021-06-30T15:23:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15#issuecomment-871499230","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg3MTUyMjI2MQ==","author":{"login":"PowerVANO"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@JdevStudios No, you should not make a video.\r\n\r\nYou have to:\r\n\r\n1. Update [README.md here on GitHub](https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/blob/master/README.md) (create a PR against the development branch)\r\n2. Provide Windows part of the guide necessary to [our manual](https://horizenofficial.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ZEN/pages/2127101965/Single+Address+Staking). This can be done by providing a Google Doc/Word document with the text and commands.","createdAt":"2021-06-30T15:51:20Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15#issuecomment-871522261","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg3NDcyMzYzMg==","author":{"login":"PowerVANO"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Thanks @JdevStudios \r\nPlease wait for our review and feedback.","createdAt":"2021-07-06T12:39:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15#issuecomment-874723632","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOELPz0c40tJl3","author":{"login":"PowerVANO"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hey @JdevStudios \r\n\r\nI have reviewed your PRs and there is lots of reused data, both for Readme and for the wiki manual. Please update both so that it only includes lines necessary for Windows compatibility. You do not need to rewrite the whole manual as it will also make it hard for us to update it on the website.\r\n\r\nFor windows instructions I would recommend just provide paragraphs and instructions where to add what so that it works for Windows as well.","createdAt":"2021-07-21T14:49:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15#issuecomment-884250999","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOELPz0c41Ncn9","author":{"login":"PowerVANO"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @JdevStudios \r\n\r\nWe did not hear from you for 2 weeks.\r\n\r\nThe task is open again for anyone who wants to take over.\r\n@JdevStudios is of course still allowed to submit a revised work in case no-one takes the task in the meantime.","createdAt":"2021-08-04T14:42:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15#issuecomment-892717565","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOELPz0c41itcC","author":{"login":"PowerVANO"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Bounty increased to $100 USD (Paid in ZEN)","createdAt":"2021-08-13T08:43:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15#issuecomment-898291458","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOELPz0c44fY3x","author":{"login":"Mlhozgr"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @PowerVANO Can we still contribute this task","createdAt":"2021-10-20T14:58:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15#issuecomment-947752433","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOELPz0c44fnsq","author":{"login":"PowerVANO"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> Hi @PowerVANO Can we still contribute this task\r\n\r\nAbsolutely! Please confirm if you start working on this one.","createdAt":"2021-10-20T16:03:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15#issuecomment-947813162","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOELPz0c47FhnS","author":{"login":"actualoser"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@PowerVANO Maybe you can walk me through this and we can create the guide here. I downloaded staketool-windows-1.3.0.zip, unzip and run staketool.exe, but it just pops up a window that disappears after a second. I have windows 10, if I change compatability to windows 8 or lower it does the same thing, but actual language generates in the window before it disappears (I don't know what I'm doing).","createdAt":"2021-12-10T21:24:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15#issuecomment-991304146","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOELPz0c5ESkul","author":{"login":"OnepercentTech"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello @PowerVANO is this task still open, if it is still open I will take it","createdAt":"2022-06-03T08:21:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15#issuecomment-1145719717","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOELPz0c8AAAABIhF7aA","author":{"login":"zhangquanshen123-droid"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @HorizenOfficial team,\n\nI noticed this bounty is still open with the `bounty_100`, `help wanted`, and `Tutorial` labels, and that the previous feedback asked for a focused Windows guide update rather than a full manual rewrite.\n\nI have a narrow update ready locally, but before opening a PR can you confirm whether the `$100 USD paid in ZEN` bounty is still active and whether a current PR plus a concise Windows guide draft is still the expected deliverable?\n\nThe prepared scope is:\n\n- README-only Windows command-line notes for the released `.exe` tools;\n- PowerShell and Command Prompt examples for `--payaddress` JSON quoting;\n- a short explanation that double-clicking the `.exe` can close the console immediately;\n- a separate Windows guide draft that can be copied into the wiki/manual section;\n- no rewrite of the existing Linux/general guide.\n\nIf you confirm the bounty and deliverable are still current, I can open the PR against the current default branch and attach/provide the guide draft for review.\n","createdAt":"2026-07-02T13:57:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15#issuecomment-4866538344","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOELPz0c8AAAABI1dKrw","author":{"login":"nexicturbo"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #27 for this bounty: https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/pull/27\n\nThe PR keeps the update narrow per the earlier maintainer feedback:\n\n- README Windows command-line notes for the released `.exe` tools\n- PowerShell examples for create/sign/send/list/getbalance/cancel/keysfromseed\n- Command Prompt JSON quoting note\n- `docs/windows-user-guide-addendum.md` with copy-ready text for the external user guide\n\nVerification:\n\n- `git diff --check`\n\nPayment details can be provided privately if this is accepted.\n","createdAt":"2026-07-05T23:00:55Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15#issuecomment-4887890607","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"createdAt":"2021-06-28T10:02:48Z","labels":[{"id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjA5MTE2MDgw","name":"HDE","description":"Label that adds the issue to the HDE website. Used for all issues we want/need help on from OS contr","color":"26db8d"},{"id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjA5MTE2MDgz","name":"bounty_100","description":"Bounty of 100 ZEN","color":"AC2375"},{"id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjA5MTE2MTEz","name":"help wanted","description":"Extra attention is needed","color":"008672"},{"id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTIzMTc3NTEw","name":"Tutorial","description":"","color":"EF1B81"}],"state":"OPEN","title":"Create Horizen Stake Verification Tool User Guide for Windows","updatedAt":"2026-07-05T23:00:55Z","url":"https://github.com/HorizenOfficial/staketool/issues/15"}
